---

<section class="section-pad" style="max-width:1200px;margin:90px auto 60px;padding:0 28px;">
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="cta-card"
    style="border-radius:28px;padding:72px 32px;text-align:center;color:#fff;background:var(--accent);"
  >
    <h2
      style="font-size:clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:0 0 16px;text-wrap:balance;"
    >
      让你的企业,拥有自己的 AI Agent
    </h2>
    <p
      style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);margin:0 auto 30px;max-width:560px;"
    >
      开源、可私有化、数据不出门。两周出可看样例,三个月见到实际效果。
    </p>
    <div class="cta-buttons" style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a
        href="https://claw.shakaka.xyz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        style="background:#fff;color:#c85f12;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:12px;transition:transform .15s;white-space:nowrap;"
      >在线试用</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/riba2534/happyclaw"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        style="background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.28), rgba(255,255,255,0.08));color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(160%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(160%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -6px 14px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);transition:background .25s, transform .15s;white-space:nowrap;"
      >⭐ Star on GitHub</a>
      <a
        href="mailto:business@happyclaw.cc?subject=HappyClaw%20企业咨询"
        style="background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.28), rgba(255,255,255,0.08));color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(160%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(160%);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -6px 14px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);transition:background .25s, transform .15s;white-space:nowrap;"
      >联系商务</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
